  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "The film is the second highest-grossing Indian film of 2026, and the highest-grossing Tamil film of 2026 and of all time.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383739722:9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "Anna Rajan confirmed her involvement in May 2025, and Suraj Venjaramoodu did so in December.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383739722:40"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Jailer 2 is a 2026 Indian Tamil-language action comedy, written and directed by Nelson Dilipkumar.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383739722:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "Rajinikanth, S. J. Suryah, Mithun Chakraborty and Suraj Venjaramoodu lead a cast that includes 2 more names, with music by Anirudh Ravichander.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1383739722:starring",
        "wiki:box:1383739722:music"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "The film was released on 15 October 2026, and according to Wikipedia its box office is ₹808 crore.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1383739722:released",
        "wiki:box:1383739722:box-office"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:43Z",
      "text": "According to the article, filming took place at Sathyam Cinemas in Royapettah, Attappadi in Kerala, Coimbatore, Kozhikode and 4 more places.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:film:1383739722:1",
        "wiki:film:1383739722:3",
        "wiki:film:1383739722:4",
        "wiki:film:1383739722:5",
        "wiki:film:1383739722:6",
        "wiki:film:1383739722:9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:01:02Z",
      "text": "Birthplaces are on record for 8 of the people credited, and all of them were born in India.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q13564588:P19",
        "wd:Q159166:P19",
        "wd:Q3520429:P19",
        "wd:Q379604:P19",
        "wd:Q4765271:P19",
        "wd:Q60068:P19",
        "wd:Q63698985:P19",
        "wd:Q7387554:P19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:01:14Z",
      "text": "On 3 November 2026, 96,128 people read the English Wikipedia article, about 8× the usual daily figure.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Jailer_2:2026-11-03",
        "views:en:Jailer_2:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:01:21Z",
      "text": "The article is read in 5 languages, and after English the most readers were in Tamil, with 210.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Jailer_2:2026-11-03",
        "views:ta:ஜெயிலர்_2:2026-11-03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:01:28Z",
      "text": "On the globe, each language glows where it is mainly spoken, brighter for more readers, and a language is not a country.",
      "cites": [
        "views:ta:ஜெயிலர்_2:2026-11-03",
